## Design direction

Custom bottle openers in zinc alloy or stainless steel combine practical leverage with a shaped surface for brand, event or hospitality artwork.

For custom metal bottle openers, begin with the part of the artwork that must read first. Keep the outline, smallest lettering, color breaks and functional details clear, then use finish and presentation to support the design rather than compete with it.

## Confirmed choices and project decisions

- Materials include zinc alloy and stainless steel.

## Preparing your brief

Send the artwork, intended dimensions, quantity, delivery destination and required timing. Note which surfaces, moving parts, attachments or packaging details matter most so the quotation can be based on one clear specification.

Golden One will use the approved brief as the basis for the final product specification; unconfirmed materials, claims and performance details are not assumed.
